# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in the working tree, whatever a
# contributor's `core.autocrlf` happens to be set to. Everything is already stored
# as LF, so this settles the convention rather than changing any content — and it
# stops a Windows checkout from producing a diff against a Linux one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Built-in diff drivers: better hunk headers, so a diff says which function or
# section it lands in.
*.rs   diff=rust
*.md   diff=markdown
*.html diff=html
*.css  diff=css

# Third party, committed so that `cargo build` is the whole build and nothing is
# fetched. It is twice the weight of the code we wrote, so keep it out of the
# language statistics and collapsed in reviews.
src/ui/vendor/** linguist-vendored
